&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;（注）１．有価証券報告書提出会社であります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:54pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-22.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt; ２.&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;「議決権等の所有(被所有)割合」は、各社が直接所有する議決権の比率及び間接所有する議決権の比率となっており、（　）内は、間接所有する比率を内数で記載しております。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:54pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-22.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt; ３．子会社 １社（非連結）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-40.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-40.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:OverviewOfAffiliatedEntitiesTextBlock>
